        "en": "Clients repeatedly commend individual groomers such as Tamara, Sophia, and Ricardo for their welcoming attitudes and attentiveness. Pet parents appreciate that staff members explain styling options clearly and discuss their pet's needs before starting. Many reviewers highlight returning regularly to the same groomer for consistent appointments."
