        "en": "Gentle approach with energetic dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners emphasize that groomers remain patient and gentle with excitable puppies and nervous rescue dogs. Reviewers share that staff take time to soothe anxious pets, helping them stay calm and cooperative during bathing and trimming. Clients frequently observe that their dogs return home relaxed, refreshed, and in good spirits."
      }
    },
    {
