      "title": {
        "en": "Satisfying baths and coat styling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers express high satisfaction with full-service baths, clean haircut shapes, and coat finishing. Pet parents note that their dogs return smelling clean, with neatly clipped nails and well-brushed fur. Multiple owners also appreciate customized styling touches, including gentle ear cleaning and creative accents requested for their pets."
      }
    }
